# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# California 2026 Governor Primary Live Tracker - Environment Variables Example
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. External Live Election Feed (Adapter Pattern)
# Set this to fetch live results from an external JSON feed.
# If unset, the app falls back to the LLM search or local mock data.
# RESULTS_FEED_URL=https://api.example.com/elections/ca-governor-2026

# 2. OpenRouter LLM Fallback with Web Search (Server-side)
# If RESULTS_FEED_URL is unset, but these are set, the server will call OpenRouter
# to search the web for the latest results and parse them defensively.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=your-openrouter-api-key
# LLM_MODEL=google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite

# 3. Vercel KV (Upstash Redis) for Gap Trend Persistence
# Used by the 5-minute cron job (/api/snapshot) to store the Xavier Becerra vs Tom Steyer gap.
# If unset, the app degrades gracefully to client-side localStorage per session.
# KV_REST_API_URL=https://your-kv-instance.upstash.io
# KV_REST_API_TOKEN=your-kv-rest-token
